<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
    PetCare design system: shared by light and dark mode.
    1. PALETTE: raw colours; values-night overrides only these entries.
    2. SEMANTIC COLOUR TOKENS: named UI roles referencing the palette.
    3. SPACING AND SIZING: dimensions, radii, icon sizes and typography sizes.
    4. TEXT APPEARANCE STYLES: existing Material 3 text roles.
    5. COMPONENT STYLES: widgets, shapes, dialog overlays and theme defaults.
    Theme colour attributes resolve through Section 2. Component references to
    theme attributes intentionally preserve local overlays (destructive dialogs).
    Enum, boolean, percentage and layout keywords retain their Android meaning.
-->
<resources>
